00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:51,000
Dear David is a horror, thriller film directed by John McPhail.

3
00:17:37,500 --> 00:17:43,500
Shortly after comic artist Adam responds to Internet
trolls, he begins experiencing sleep paralysis.

4
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
As he chronicles increasingly malevolent occurrences in a series of tweets, Adam begins
to believe he is being haunted by the ghost of a dead child named David.

